v><div class="field wide"><label for="working_hours">Working hours</label><input id="working_hours" name="working_hours" value="<?=e($data['working_hours'])?>"></div></div></section><section class="section"><h2>Analytics</h2><div class="grid"><div class="field wide"><label class="toggle"><input type="checkbox" name="analytics_enabled" <?=!empty($data['analytics']['enabled'])?'checked':''?>> Enable analytics</label></div><div class="field"><label for="analytics_provider">Provider</label><input id="analytics_provider" name="analytics_provider" value="<?=e($data['analytics']['provider'])?>"></div><div class="field"><label for="analytics_id">Tracking ID</label><input id="analytics_id" name="analytics_id" value="<?=e($data['analytics']['id'])?>"></div></div></section><div class="actions"><div class="hint">JSON UTF-8 · pretty-print · LOCK_EX · CSRF protected.</div><button class="save" type="submit">SAVE SETTINGS →</button></div></form><section class="section" style="margin-top:38px"><h2>Admin Access Key</h2><div class="security"><p>Kalit faqat joriy admin kalitini tasdiqlagandan keyin almashtiriladi. Plaintext kalit JSON yoki GitHub repositoryga yozilmaydi; serverdagi <code>config/admin_secret.php</code> faylida hash sifatida saqlanadi.</p><form method="post" autocomplete="off"><input type="hidden" name="csrf" value="<?=e(adminCsrfToken())?>"><input type="hidden" name="action" value="rotate_key"><div class="grid"><div class="field"><label for="current_key">Current key</label><input id="current_key" name="current_key" type="password" required></div><div class="field"><label for="new_key">New key</label><input id="new_key" name="new_key" type="password" minlength="10" maxlength="256" required></div><div class="field wide"><label for="new_key_confirm">Confirm new key</label><input id="new_key_confirm" name="new_key_confirm" type="password" minlength="10" maxlength="256" required></div></div><div class="actions"><div class="hint">Kamida 10 belgi. Key almashtirilgandan so‘ng session yangilanadi.</div><button class="save danger" type="submit">ROTATE ACCESS KEY →</button></div></form></div></section><p class="footer">data/settings.json · global content contract · zero dependencies</p></main></div></body></html>